# Credential material — NEVER commit. The event-contract lane, its code and its keys
# were all removed in Sep 2026 (the API key was a PRODUCTION credential and should be
# revoked exchange-side). These patterns are kept as a standing guard: dropping them
# once made `git add -A` stage a file straight out of the credentials directory, and
# they cost nothing while that repo stays public.
